  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br>**Welcome to 'Saltwater Gospel' - Your Idyllic 30A Getaway!**<br>Nestled in the heart of 30A, 'Saltwater Gospel' invites you to immerse yourself in a coastal retreat that promises tranquility, comfort, and convenience. This captivating 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom townhome is more than just a vacation rental—it's a doorway to cherished memories and unforgettable experiences.<br><br>The Space:<br>**Coastal Chic Elegance**<br>Step inside and be embraced by an atmosphere of coastal chic elegance. The interiors are thoughtfully designed with modern furnishings, blending comfort with style. With ample room for everyone, this townhome is perfect for families, friends, or groups seeking a remarkable stay on 30A.<br><br>**Rooftop Views Like No Other**<br>One of the crown jewels of 'Saltwater Gospel' is its sprawling rooftop offering panoramic views of the Gulf. Imagine sipping your morning coffee as the sun paints the sky with hues of orange and pink, or winding down with a glass of wine while the stars twinkle above. These 180-degree vistas are more than just views; they're an experience in themselves.<br><br>**Unbeatable Location**<br>Location is key, and 'Saltwater Gospel' hits the mark perfectly. Situated right next door to Gulfplace, you're just a leisurely 2-minute walk away from the pristine sandy beaches that 30A is known for. Sink your toes in the sand, soak up the sun, or take a refreshing swim in the Gulf. And when hunger strikes, you have a plethora of dining options at your doorstep—no need to drive, just indulge in a culinary journey.<br><br>**Your Home Away from Home**<br>'Saltwater Gospel' is equipped with all the modern amenities you need for a seamless stay. The fully stocked kitchen invites your inner chef to create culinary masterpieces. Each bedroom is a cozy haven, promising restful nights after your daily adventures. <br><br>On the third floor, you'll find two master bedrooms, each with a king-sized bed and en-suite bathrooms. These luxurious rooms offer the ultimate in comfort and privacy. On the second floor, there is a guest bedroom located conveniently next to the kitchen and living room. The first floor features a bunk room, perfect for kids or additional guests.<br><br>The thoughtful touches, from complimentary Wi-Fi to plush linens, ensure your comfort is prioritized.<br><br>**30A Adventures Await**<br>Beyond the comforts of 'Saltwater Gospel,' the wonders of 30A beckon. Explore charming coastal communities, browse local boutiques, and savor fresh seafood at nearby restaurants. Whether you're an outdoor enthusiast, a foodie, or an art lover, 30A offers an array of activities to suit every interest.<br><br>**Rooftop Terrace Games**<br>Don't forget to check out the rooftop terrace for some added fun! You'll find games like Cornhole, Jenga, and Connect 4, perfect for spending quality time with family and friends.<br><br>**Book Your Escape**<br>Your 'Saltwater Gospel' escape is just a booking away. Unlock the door to an extraordinary 30A vacation where sun, sea, and relaxation converge. Let the memories begin—reserve your dates now and embark on a journey that promises cherished moments and endless smiles. Your 30A adventure starts here!<br><br><br>HOME CONFIGURATION + SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS:<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- 2 Bunkbeds: Full/Full and Twin/Twin (Sleeps 6)<br>- en-suite bathroom<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Bedroom with queen bed (Sleeps 2)<br>- Living area<br>- Kitchen <br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- Bedroom with king bed (Sleeps 2)<br>- Bedroom with king bed (Sleeps 2)<br>- Both bedrooms have en-suite bathrooms<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR<br>- Rooftop patio<br><br><br>Amenities:<br>- Rooftop patio with Gulf views<br>- Beach access just a 2-minute walk away<br>- Close proximity to diverse dining options<br>- 4 Complimentary bikes and beach gear for your enjoyment<br>- Smart TV's in every room - with apps for network channels, Netflix, Hulu, YouTubeTV, etc.<br>- Parking for one car in the driveway<br>- Full size washer and dryer<br>- Complimentary Wi-Fi<br><br>Enhance Your Stay with Exclusive Upgrades! <br>Make the most of your vacation with this premium add-on, designed for ultimate comfort and convenience! And don’t worry—no need to decide now! We will send you a text a few days before check-in if you'd like to add them.<br><br>**Upgrade your vacation with a premium 6-seater golf cart for just $100/night!<br>- Perfect for exploring 30A, local dining spots, and boutique shops.<br>- Already on the property for ultimate ease!<br><br><br>ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>- Must be 25 years old to book and stay at the property during entire reservation period<br>- No pets<br>- Just a quick heads-up: once you book we'll be using our nifty guest messaging platform for all our chit-chats, so keep an eye on your text for messages from our 850 phone number. Additionally, before the fun begins, we'll need you to sign our rental agreement that has a $100 authorization hold for incidentals. It's all part of the check-in charm! Thanks for being awesome!<br><br>Guest Access:<br>When you choose Saltwater Gospel for your vacation, you gain exclusive access to the entire residence, ensuring a private and comfortable retreat for you and your guests",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
